[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17461.51, "timestamp": "04:51:01", "text": "需要注射，但我们需要腐烂才能注射。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17463.59, "timestamp": "04:51:03", "text": "试过了。哦，是的，她会掉下去的。哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17467.43, "timestamp": "04:51:07", "text": "等等，你可以……你可以……你可以……你可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17470.23, "timestamp": "04:51:10", "text": "系统准备好了吗？那会很有用。哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17472.23, "timestamp": "04:51:12", "text": "你一直在丧失理智。哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17475.35, "timestamp": "04:51:15", "text": "但这并不能构成系统。是的，齿轮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17478.07, "timestamp": "04:51:18", "text": "任何事物。约翰，乔布，过去那边去。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17480.708, "timestamp": "04:51:20", "text": "让我去拿那些齿轮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17483.05, "timestamp": "04:51:23", "text": "那就快点儿。我需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17484.868, "timestamp": "04:51:24", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17487.27, "timestamp": "04:51:27", "text": "我来了。是的，我开始明白了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17489.19, "timestamp": "04:51:29", "text": "也饿了。我得去买点吃的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17491.83, "timestamp": "04:51:31", "text": "我也没有吃的。很少"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17495.19, "timestamp": "04:51:35", "text": "食物。我可能需要开始做饭了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17497.91, "timestamp": "04:51:37", "text": "拉屎。谁能做个慢炖锅？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17499.91, "timestamp": "04:51:39", "text": "如何？那是什么？我忘了怎么做一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17502.788, "timestamp": "04:51:42", "text": "公鸡锅。呃，我们只需要六个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17506.15, "timestamp": "04:51:46", "text": "木炭、三块切割过的石头和两块"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17507.51, "timestamp": "04:51:47", "text": "棍子。我想我们得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17509.67, "timestamp": "04:51:49", "text": "足够的。我们只需要切割好的石头。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17512.23, "timestamp": "04:51:52", "text": "谁他妈拿了我的浇水壶？哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17513.59, "timestamp": "04:51:53", "text": "不。就在这里。就在这里。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17519.91, "timestamp": "04:51:59", "text": "如果你输了，你的理智值就会很低。"}]